      "tab_support": "Support",
      "summary_default": "Pick a position",
      "summary_fmt": "{pos}",
      "summary_cnt": "{pos} · {n} selected",
      "hint": "Pick a position from the tabs, then click champions to allow or disallow them there. A listed champion can play the positions it is listed in and any position whose list is empty; an unlisted champion can only play empty positions. Rules and formulas: see the middle column.",
      "rules_title": "Rules & formulas",
      "rules_short": "· Listed champion → its positions + positions with an empty list\n· Unlisted champion → empty positions only\n· Current ≥ needed → active\n  short → that position is unrestricted\n· Current = champions that can play it\n\n[Needed = base + leak]\n· Base = 1 + 2×bans + R\n  classic 2+2b · fearless 6+2b\n  hard fearless 10+2b (5 bans → 20)\n· R = per-lane leak cap\n  classic 1 · fearless 5 · hard 9\n  (assumes 5 sets)\n· Leak = over the other lanes, the sum of\n  'this position's champions that can also play that lane' (max R)\n  - empty lane → usually R\n    e.g. only top listed: 20 + 9×4 = 56\n  - otherwise only overlaps count\n  → listing other positions brings it down to the base\n· Overlapping groups are checked the same way\n· 'N short' = counted by adding one by one\n\n[Ban cards] same rule as the game\n· Your setting if possible, else the default (3 with 40+ released, else 2)\n\n[Draft / swap]\n· Picks that make seating impossible are grey (hover for the reason)\n· Unfillable positions give free picks; nothing legal → grey lifts\n· Illegal swap → re-seated once; confirm disabled while illegal\n· AI teams follow the same rules\n\n[Saving] changes apply at once · 'OK' writes them to the save",
      "clear_pos": "Clear this position (allow all)",
      "select_all_pos": "Select all for this position",
      "class_all_title": "Select all by class (click again to clear)",
